/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:1797:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local copy/scripts/build_arc_codegen_prompts_with_similarity.py:98:    "relation:overlap": ["overlap", "projection", "覆盖", "重叠", "投影"],
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2856:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:12:      "docstring": "Reveal the rectangular patch hidden by the solid marker using the grid's reflection symmetries.\n\nInput structure:\n- A square colored pattern with one solid rectangular marker color occluding a patch.\n- The visible pattern has horizontal and vertical reflection symmetry on a large lower/right strip.\n- The top and left outer strips also expose transpose counterparts for cells not recoverable by those reflections.\n\nRule:\n- Find the unique color whose full extent is a solid rectangle; this rectangle is the output region.\n- Infer the reflected strip start as the smallest row/column offset whose lower/right strips are mirror-consistent, ignoring marker pixels.\n- For each marker pixel, copy the unique non-marker value in its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; if that orbit is entirely hidden in the outer strip, use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart.\n\nKey insight:\nThe marker is not part of the pattern; it covers a missing rectangle whose cells are still determined by the visible mirror or transpose copies elsewhere in the grid.",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2857:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:16:        "src": "solid rectangular marker over a mirrored color pattern",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2858:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:17:        "dst": "hidden marker-sized rectangle",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2859:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:18:        "transform": "replace each marker pixel by the matching pixel from its horizontal/vertical reflection orbit; use the transposed top/left-strip counterpart when that orbit is also hidden",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2860:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:19:        "grid_shape": "crop to marker bbox"
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2861:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:24:        "catalog:marker_pixels",
/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/code/fable/2/015/codegen_5.skill_011_020.log:2862:/home/lixinyu/snap/a/key_combo/skill/arc-codegen-similar-local/arc_reference_index.json:29:        "object:marker",
